environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Dockside (Riverport & Maritime Industrial Basin, Yarrow River, Blackwood City);
Setting: Working riverport industrial docks, shipping container yards, and river barge transit points;
Factions: Longshoremen & Stevedore Union, Riverboat Pilots Guild, Vito Marino Syndicate, DCC Maritime Border Patrol;
Conflicts: Contraband smuggling runs vs customs enforcement, labor strikes vs syndicate extortion;
Society: Hardened maritime culture, tight-lipped docker solidarity, cash-in-hand transactions]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Brackish river mist, creaking wooden moorings, rusted steel containers, diesel exhaust, river mud, and low foghorns;
Architecture: Sprawling corrugated metal warehouses, heavy gantry cranes, timber cargo piers, weathered dockside taverns;
Security & Wards: DCC river radar, automated cargo scanners, union sentinels guarding warehouse access;
Demographics: Water-shifters, minotaurs handling heavy freight, roughneck river pilots, goblin salvagers;
Rules & Restrictions: Obey union unloading shifts, do not touch unmarked crates without manifest permission]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Developed along the deep Yarrow River channel to link inland California resource trade to the Pacific coast;
Secrets: Deep underwater caissons beneath pier 7 conceal cold-storage lockers used for untraceable off-the-books contraband]
